==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|bismerwen|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|ang}} {{term|besmirwan|lang=ang}}, {{term|besmierwan||to besmear|lang=ang}}, equivalent to {{prefix|be|smear}}. Cognate with {{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|besmeren||to besmear|lang=nl}}, {{etyl|de|-}} {{term|beschmieren||to besmear|lang=de}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{transitive}} To [[smear]] over; smear all over; [[sully]].
